Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've now launched today we announced our Windows sandbox which runs on a CPU.\N今天我们正式发布：基于 CPU 运行的 Windows 沙箱。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.03,0:00:10.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,So if you need an agent to do like on legacy software which is like all finance, all support, all um that's all there.\N所以如果你需要一个智能体来处理像旧软件这样的任务，比如所有财务、所有支持，这些都在里面。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.36,0:00:15.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I'll also to your point like reinforcement learning, we have a bunch of people that usually use like Kubernetes.\N但就你提到的强化学习而言，我们有很多客户通常用 Kubernetes，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.88,0:00:16.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now they would use us.\N现在他们会用我们。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.93,0:00:22.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the interesting thing is the the size and scale of these loads are insanely large and they're growing insanely large.\N但有趣的是，这些负载的规模和体量大得惊人，而且还在急剧扩大。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:26.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we're like the smallest cloud in the world.\N而我们大概是世界上最小的云。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.41,0:00:33.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,So my interest to what in the question is like if we as a very very small company have this much, what does that do at the large scale, right?\N所以，我对这个问题的兴趣在于，如果我们作为一家非常非常小的公司，\N已经能做到这种程度，那么在大规模上会怎样呢，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:37.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like so um and we've had I'm curious if you have any insight on this,\N就像这样，呃，我很好奇，你对这个问题有什么见解吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.52,0:00:43.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,but just just RL let alone the long running agents which are on their own, we we see customers coming in.\N但仅仅是强化学习，更不用说那些独立运行的长期智能体，我们已经看到客户纷纷上门。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.08,0:00:46.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,One of them ran a million one single customer yesterday in the span of 6 hours.\N其中一位客户昨天在 6 小时内跑了一百万个这样的 CPU 工作负载。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.01,0:00:48.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like 1 million of these CPU workloads.\N像一百万个这样的CPU工作负载。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.63,0:00:49.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that's one customer.\N这就是一位客户。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.71,0:00:51.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so like how many of these customers are doing RL?\N那么，有多少客户在使用强化学习呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:52.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're going to need this.\N他们将会需要这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.30,0:00:55.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I I don't know if you have any insights on this, but I'm just curious.\N我不确定你有没有什么见解，只是有点好奇。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.17,0:00:59.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um I mean I mean there there there there are some pretty uh shocking metrics.\N呃，我的意思是，有些数据确实相当惊人。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.41,0:01:01.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like a million vCPUs sounds insane.\N一百万个 vCPU 听起来太疯狂了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.97,0:01:09.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um but there some of the some of the scale of the workloads and contracts people are signing are are even like more ridiculous than that, right?\N但有些工作负载和合同的规模，人们签下的甚至比那还荒谬，对吧？
